attribution: Music by Jerome Kern (died 1945), words by Oscar Hammerstein II (died 1960); from the musical "Show Boat", published by T. B. Harms Co. in 1927 (the refrain with its original published words, the period dialect spellings written in standard spelling). Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
